<title>GERMANY: BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BIATHLON-WORLD CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RUHPOLDING, Germany 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of World Cup biathlon team events on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men's 10-km team event</p>
<p> 1. Austria (Hannes Obererlacher, Reinhard Neuner, Wolfgang  Perner, Ludwig Gredler) 24 minutes 57.3 seconds (1 penalty  circuit)</p>
<p> 2. Norway (Halvard Hanevold, Egil Gjelland, Jon Age Tyldum, Dag  Bjoerndalen) 25:19.8 (1)</p>
<p> 3. Germany (Ricco Gross, Mark Kirchner, Carsten Heymann, Sven  Fischer) 25:53.0 (4)</p>
<p> 4. Belarus			 26:12.3 (3)</p>
<p> 5. Czech Republic		26:12.8 (2)</p>
<p> 6. Russia			  26:12.9 (5)</p>
<p> 7. Italy			   26:20.8 (3)</p>
<p> 8. France			  26:33.1 (3)</p>
<p> 9. Slovenia			26:38.6 (4)</p>
<p> 10. Japan			  26:52.4 (6)</p>
<p>Women's 7.5-km team event</p>
<p> 1. Russia (Galina Kukleva, Olga Romasko, Nadezhda Talanova,  Olga Melnik) 23:08.1 (1)</p>
<p> 2. Germany (Kathi Schwaab, Katrin Apel, Petra Behle, Uschi  Disl) 24:06.4 (3)</p>
<p> 3. Ukraine (Olena Zubrilova/Irina Kortshagina/Valentina  Tserbe/Tatyana Vodopyanova) 24:28.0 (3)</p>
